[0.000, "o", "   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m4  \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33mThe forensic investigation into Fred Rocba's SRL-provided Surface system has uncovered a highly coordinated, multi-phased **insider threat operation** executed by Fred Rocba himself, who utilized the alias \"Cobra\" / \"Redguard\" (`redguard.cobra@gmail.com`). \r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m5  \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m6  \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33mFred Rocba was hired on October 24, 2020, and began work on October 26, 2020. Shortly after starting, on November 10, 2020, he left for a planned vacation to Disney. On November 13, 2020, a home burglary was reported, apparently targeting his SRL Surface system.\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m7  \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m8  \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33mHowever, forensic evidence proves that the burglary was staged or coordinated. Starting just hours after the reported burglary on November 13, 2020, the system was booted, and Fred (or an accomplice using his credentials) connected multiple physical USB drives (designated D:, E:, and "]
[0.001, "o", "F:) which had been previously paired with the system as early as November 1, 2020. \r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m9  \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m   \u001b[0m \u001b[2m10 \u001b[0m |\u001b[33m+\u001b[0m\u001b[33mThe actor systematically harvested and exfiltrated highly confidential Stark Research Labs (SRL) project documents, schematics, blueprints, and a complete Outlook email archive (`SRL-EMAIL-EXPORT.pst`). The exfiltration targeted ten high-value projects, including Project KITT, Project Megaforce, Project Airwolf, Project Vibranium, Project Gunstar, and Project Blue Thunder. \r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m5  \u001b[0m \u001b[2m11 \u001b[0m |\u001b[2m \u001b[0m\u001b[2m\r\n\u001b[0m\u001b[2m6  \u001b[0m \u001b[2m   \u001b[0m |\u001b[31m-\u001b[0m\u001b[31mWhile Fred Rocba was away on a planned vacation to Disney, an intruder broke into his home on November 13, 2020. Forensic evidence shows that starting just hours after the burglary (at 19:45 UTC/local system time on Nov 13), the compromised system was booted, external USB drives (designated E:, F:, and D:) were connected, and the local Google Drive client/sync folder was utilized."]
